# Zenelait AI CRM — Nine Tenants, Roles, Pages & Buttons Master Guide

---

## 1. Executive Platform Architecture

**Zenelait AI CRM** is an enterprise-grade multi-tenant SaaS platform serving 9 distinct industry verticals. It is architected with a two-tier operational hierarchy:
1. **Ultra Super Admin (Platform Root / God Mode)**: Global command center with cross-company authority over tenant provisioning, SaaS packages, ARR/MRR financial reconciliation, usage quotas, AI model gateways, and emergency disaster recovery.
2. **Tenant Workspaces (9 Industry Verticals)**: Isolated organizational workspaces tailored with custom data models, 50 human roles, 25 autonomous AI agents, and 349 dedicated sidebar feature buttons.

---

## 2. Ultra Super Admin (Platform Command Center)

The Ultra Super Admin operates at the root platform level above all tenants (`/api/v1/platform/*`).

### 2.1 Navigation & Pages
Accessible via the sidebar button **Platform Command Center** (`tenants` / `platform-admin`).

#### Tabs Inside Platform Command Center:
1. **Command Dashboard** (`overview`): Real-time MRR (₹18.5L), ARR (₹2.22 Cr), 9 Active Tenants, 48 Active AI Agents, 842k Monthly AI Actions, 99.98% System Uptime.
2. **Tenant Fleet** (`tenants`): Directory of all 9 tenant companies (`ABC Technologies`, `Green Acres Realty`, `Apollo Zenith Clinic`, `Zenith Global Academy`, `Zenith Retail Hub`, `Heritage Grand Hotel`, `Wanderlust Holidays`, `Bharat Precision Gears`, `Apex Global Advisory`).
   - **Buttons & Actions**:
     - `Provision Tenant Workspace`: Opens modal to provision new company with custom domain, seats, and industry vertical.
     - `1-Click Impersonate`: Starts audited delegated support session into that tenant.
     - `Adjust Live Quotas`: Modifies seats, storage (GB), monthly AI message limits, and WhatsApp credits on the fly.
     - `Suspend / Resume Tenant`: Instantly toggles tenant status between `ACTIVE` and `SUSPENDED`.
3. **Public Inquiries & Provisioning** (`queries`): Inbound leads from public website requesting CRM onboarding.
   - **Buttons & Actions**:
     - `Review Inquiry`: Inspects company name, employee size, industry vertical, and contact details.
     - `Approve & 1-Click Provision`: Converts contact inquiry directly into a live tenant workspace with initial free trial credentials.
     - `Reject / Archive`: Flags spam or rejected inquiries.
4. **SaaS Package Catalog** (`packages`): Manages platform subscription packages (`Starter`, `Growth`, `Professional`, `Enterprise Sovereign`).
   - **Buttons & Actions**:
     - `New SaaS Package`: Modal to configure tier name, monthly/quarterly/annual pricing, seat quotas, and storage.
     - `Edit Quotas & Pricing`: Updates pricing and resource caps with version incrementing.
     - `Toggle Verticals`: Selects which of the 9 industry verticals can purchase this package.
     - `Duplicate Tier`: Clones an existing package for rapid A/B pricing testing.
5. **Revenue & Financial Ledger** (`revenue`): SaaS revenue analytics, billing cycles, gross profit margin (72.4%), and AI compute cost breakdown.
   - **Subtabs**:
     - `Revenue Overview`: High-level MRR, ARR, net profitability, churn rate (1.2%), and upgrades/downgrades.
     - `Vertical Revenue Breakdown`: Revenue share per industry vertical (Software: 29.7%, Realty: 17.3%, Healthcare: 11.4%, etc.).
     - `Package Contribution`: Revenue contribution breakdown by package tier.
     - `MRR/ARR Trajectory`: 6-month historical revenue trendline.
6. **Invoicing & Failed Payments** (`invoices`): Cross-tenant invoices, automated gateway receipts, and dunning management.
   - **Buttons & Actions**:
     - `View Invoice Details`: Inspects line items, GST/tax calculations, and transaction IDs.
     - `Void Invoice`: Marks invoice as voided with mandatory reason audit.
     - `Issue Refund`: Triggers full or partial credit refund through payment gateway.
     - `Retry Failed Charge`: Re-dispatches payment retry for failed credit card or UPI transactions.
7. **AI Fleet Governance** (`ai-governance`): Global AI model gateway settings (GPT-4o, Claude 3.5 Sonnet, Gemini 1.5 Pro, Llama 3).
   - **Buttons & Actions**:
     - `Switch Primary LLM`: Configures platform default model provider and fallback latency routes.
     - `Configure Safety Guardrails`: Enforces medical non-diagnosis, legal disclaimer, and privacy PII filters across all tenants.
     - `Live Token Usage`: Tracks prompt/completion token consumption per tenant.
8. **Disaster Recovery & Security Lockdown** (`security`):
   - **Buttons & Actions**:
     - `Trigger Cloud Snapshot`: Takes point-in-time database snapshot.
     - `Restore Snapshot`: Restores database to a verified historical snapshot.
     - `EMERGENCY PLATFORM LOCKDOWN`: Freezes all tenant outbound communications (Email/WhatsApp) in the event of an API key breach.
     - `Export Security Audit Trail`: Downloads CSV of all administrator actions.

