## 4. Universal Core Modules (Company Admin View)

Every tenant company administrator has access to the 18 universal core CRM modules:

1. **Dashboard** (`dashboard`): Executive KPIs, pipeline stages, revenue targets, and recent AI actions.
2. **Company Profile** (`company-profile`): Branding logo, address, contact email, default currency, and time zone.
3. **Users & Roles** (`users-roles`): Team member directory, role assignment, and access permission matrix.
4. **Subscription & Billing** (`subscription-billing`): Plan tier, monthly usage meters, invoices, and payment method.
5. **Leads** (`leads`, `lead-details`): Lead list, BANT scoring, status tags, and lead conversion button.
6. **Customers** (`customers`): Converted customer accounts with contact history and deal values.
7. **Opportunities** (`opportunities`): Visual Kanban sales pipeline with drag-and-drop deal progression.
8. **Tasks & Reminders** (`tasks`): To-do items, follow-up deadlines, priority badges, and task completion checkboxes.
9. **Calendar & Appointments** (`calendar`): Integrated appointment calendar with Google Meet/Zoom integration.
10. **AI Employees** (`ai-employees`): Active AI fleet status, containment rates, accuracy metrics, and pause/resume toggles.
11. **Agent Builder** (`agent-builder`): Custom AI agent creation, prompt engineering, and capability checkboxes.
12. **Omnichannel Inbox** (`conversations`): Unified communications (Email, WhatsApp, Web Chat) with human takeover.
13. **Templates** (`templates`): Reusable email and WhatsApp broadcast message templates.
14. **Knowledge Base** (`knowledge-base`): Document repository, FAQs, and vector search indexing for AI agents.
15. **Automation Center** (`automation-center`): Workflow builder, trigger events, condition filters, and action nodes.
16. **Reports & Analytics** (`reports`): Executive analytics, lead source distribution, and team sales velocity.
17. **Integrations** (`integrations`): Third-party connectors (Razorpay, Stripe, WhatsApp Cloud API, SendGrid, Slack).
18. **Products / Solutions** (`products` / vertical catalog): Tenant industry catalog editor.

